[/latex] Considering 1 mole of biomass [latex]\mathrm{BOD}_{4}=160 \mathrm{gm} / \mathrm{mol}[/latex] [latex]\therefore \quad \mathrm{BOD}_{5}=\mathrm{BOD}_{4}\left(1-\mathrm{e}^{-\mathrm{k}_{0} \mathrm{t}}\right)[/latex] [latex]=160\left(1-e^{-0.23 \times 5}\right)[/latex] [latex]=160 \times 0.6833[/latex] [latex]=109.34 \mathrm{gm} / \mathrm{mol}[/latex] Calculation of TOC: [latex]\mathrm{TOC}=\frac{12 \times 5}{113} \times 113=60 \mathrm{gm} / \mathrm{mol}[/latex] ( [latex]\because 1[/latex] mole biomass is considered) [latex]\therefore[/latex] Required Ratio [latex]=\frac{109.34}{60}=1.82[/latex]

