\end{aligned}[/latex] Eulers backward difference scheme [latex]\begin{aligned}
u_{n}-u_{n-1} & =h f\left(t_{n}, u_{n}\right)=h\left(1-2 t_{n} u n^{2}\right) \\
& =0.01\left(1-2 \times 3.14 \times 1.75^{2}\right) \\
& =-0.1822
\end{aligned}[/latex]

Given matrix is [latex]4 \times 4 [/latex] and rank of matrix is 2 . Therefore, rank of matrix [latex]\neq[/latex] No. of variables Thus, there two linearly dependent vectors \& two linearly independent vectors are present. [latex]
