[/latex] [latex]\therefore \quad X=\mathrm{K}_{1}\left[\begin{array}{l}2 \\ 1 \\ 0 \\ 3\end{array}\right]+\mathrm{K}_{2}\left[\begin{array}{l}1 \\ 0 \\ 1 \\ 2\end{array}\right][/latex] For [latex]\mathrm{K}_{1}=1 \text{ and } \mathrm{~K}_{2}=-1[/latex] [latex]X=\left[\begin{array}{c}1 \\ 1 \\ -1 \\ 1\end{array}\right]=\left[\begin{array}{llll}1 & 1 & -1 & 1\end{array}\right]^{\top}[/latex]

